    "A deadline belongs to this list, not to a single task.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "期限はリスト全体のもので、個々のタスクのものではありません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "期限属于整张清单，不是某一项任务。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "期限屬於整張清單，不是某一項任務。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A new list is created in your workspace. The template itself stays untouched.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "リストが新しく作られます。テンプレート自体は変更されません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会在你的清单里新建一张，模板本身不会被改动。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "會在你的清單裡新建一張，範本本身不會被改動。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A new list is made from this template each time you open the app after a period has passed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "期間が過ぎたあとにアプリを開くと、このテンプレートから新しいリストが作られます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每一期过去后，下次打开 App 时会用这个模板生成一张新清单。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每一期過去後，下次開啟 App 時會用這個範本產生一張新清單。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A nudge before the deadline": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "期限前に知らせる"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "期限前提醒我"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "期限前提醒我"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A template is a list you can pull into your workspace again and again — with its checklist already written.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "テンプレートは、チェック項目まで書き終えたリストを何度でも呼び出せるようにしたものです。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模板就是一张可以反复拉进清单的清单，检查项已经写好了。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "範本就是一張可以反覆拉進清單的清單，檢查項已經寫好了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
